WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.600
Neck stretch: tilt your head towards one shoulder and hold for a slow breath.

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:09.000
Shoulder stretch: pull one arm across your chest, then switch sides.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.800
Seated twist: sit tall, hold the backrest and turn gently from the waist.
